    `  - It stores conversation history as ResponseItems and builds each model prompt from normalized history + fixed session context (developer
        instructions, AGENTS/user instructions, environment context). See codex-rs/core/src/codex.rs:2493, codex-rs/core/src/codex.rs:2446, codex-rs/
